          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رکاوٹ (rukāvaṭ) is built on رکنا, \"to stop\", which CDIAL lists beside roknā under rokk, \"stop\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 10827); -āvaṭ makes the noun: what stops you."
            }
          ]
