              "text": "نبٹانا (nibṭānā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin nibṭānā, \"finishes\", beside nibaṭnā, \"to be settled\", under Sanskrit nírvartate (CDIAL 7395). To bring a matter to its end; Urdu also says nimṭānā."
